  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.CeramicOASIS v2.0.3\n\nConnects the OASIS to the Ceramic Network decentralised data protocol via the Ceramic HTTP API. Maps DIDs to OASIS Avatars and Ceramic streams to OASIS Holons. Supports ComposeDB queries. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- feat: add 6 new OASIS providers — BlueSky, Matrix, Filecoin, Algorand, Ceramic, Basechain (b2e78ba)\n- feat: complete all 13 unpublished NuGet providers to publish-ready standard — READMEs, release notes, logo, metadata, copyright (0263a2b)\n- fix: put every project in a solution and fix the bugs that exposed (4612aa0)\n- Integrate provider capabilities and reuse deployed service configuration (8ac7f1f)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Blockchain/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.CeramicOASIS",
